          "pageContent": "Core company profile \n• Name: Literally AI Partners. \n• Nature of business: AI automation, AI agents, and workflow design for growth, lead \ngeneration, content, and operations. \n• Typical clients: Personal brands, solo founders, creators, small agencies, and lean \nSaaS businesses that want to grow without hiring a large team. \n• Core tech stack: n8n, modern LLMs, voice AI, API integrations (email, CRM, calendars, \npayments, social media). \n \nServices and offers \n• AI email & DM agents \n• Auto-reply to inbound emails/DMs for leads, FAQs, and basic support. \n• Classifies messages, drafts replies, escalates complex cases to humans, and \nlogs everything. \n• AI voice agents & website widgets \n• Voice widget on the site to answer questions, book appointments, take \npayments, send confirmations, and push data to sheets/CRM. \n• Used for appointment-setters, pre-qualification, and 24/7 support. \n• Automation & n8n workflows \n• End-to-end customer journeys: lead capture → follow-up → content"
        }
      },
