          "pageContent": "• Used for appointment-setters, pre-qualification, and 24/7 support. \n• Automation & n8n workflows \n• End-to-end customer journeys: lead capture → follow-up → content \nrepurposing → reporting. \n• Integrations with email tools, calendars, payment gateways, spreadsheets, \nand CRMs. \n• Content & personal brand automations \n• Reddit / LinkedIn / multi-platform content workflows: idea sourcing, drafting, \nscheduling, and analytics. \n• Systems to turn long-form assets (podcasts, YouTube, newsletters) into daily \nposts. \n• Strategy & consulting \n• Audit of current processes, identification of “automation wins,” and an \nimplementation roadmap. \n• Option to run experiments and A/B tests to prove uplift in leads or revenue \nbefore scaling."
        }
      },
