          "pageContent": "Pricing model (example structure) \nYou can adjust these numbers, but this structure is realistic for international clients. \n• One-time project setup \n• Small workflow / micro-automation: USD 300–700 (e.g., a simple \nlead-capture → email → sheet flow). \n• Standard system (e.g., full AI email agent or basic voice agent): USD 1,000–\n2,000. \n• Advanced system (multi-channel agent + payment + reporting): USD 2,000–\n4,000+. \n• Monthly retainers \n• Maintenance tier: USD 100–250/month for monitoring, minor fixes, and \nupdates. \n• Growth tier: USD 300–700/month for ongoing improvements, new \nworkflows, and reporting. \n• Scale tier: USD 1,000+/month for active experimentation, multi-agent \nsystems, and priority support. \n• Billing & currency \n• Default: USD pricing; INR available for Indian clients. \n• Payment methods: international gateways like Stripe/PayPal/Wise (or \nRazorpay for INR), subject to availability and age/legal constraints in India. \n \nExample pricing table"
        }
