          "pageContent": "• Payment methods: international gateways like Stripe/PayPal/Wise (or \nRazorpay for INR), subject to availability and age/legal constraints in India. \n \nExample pricing table \nOffer type Typical client use case Price range (USD) \nAI email agent Auto-handling inbound leads & FAQs \n1,000–2,000 setup + 100–\n250/month  \nAI voice widget Site widget for support + bookings + payments \n1,500–2,500 setup + 100–\n200/month"
