          "pageContent": "Offer type Typical client use case Price range (USD) \nContent \nautomation \nReddit/LinkedIn content + repurposing \nworkflows 700–2,000 setup + 150–400/month  \nFull automation \nhub \nMulti-channel agents, CRM, reporting, \nexperimentation \n2,000–4,000+ setup + 500–\n1,000+/month  \n \nEngagement process \n•  \n1. Discovery \n• 30–60 minute call to understand the business model, current funnel, and \nmain constraints. \n• Basic assessment of whether AI agents and automation can realistically move \nrevenue, cost, or time. \n•  \n2. Proposal \n• Clear scope (what will be automated), timelines, and pricing; usually shared \nwithin a few days of the call. \n• Includes list of tools to be used and responsibilities (what the client needs to \nprovide: access, accounts, etc.). \n•  \n3. Build & implementation \n• Iterative build with tests in a staging or test environment before going live. \n• Weekly or bi-weekly check-ins until launch. \n•  \n4. Post-launch"
