          "pageContent": "This is a generic, service-style policy; adapt with a lawyer and local regulations in mind. \n• Strategy/discovery fees \n• Strategy calls, audits, and discovery workshops are non-refundable once \ndelivered, because the value is in time and expertise. \n• Project builds (fixed-fee work) \n• A non-refundable deposit (e.g., 30–50%) is paid to reserve the slot and start \nwork. \n• Remaining amount is typically due on milestone completion (e.g., after \napproval of key flows) or just before final delivery. \n• Refunds for project work are generally not offered after significant work is \ncompleted, but the company may choose to offer partial refunds or credits \ncase-by-case if the client stops early. \n• Retainers & subscriptions \n• Retainer payments are usually non-refundable for the current billing period, \nsince work capacity is reserved in advance. \n• Clients can cancel future months with written notice (e.g., 14–30 days before \nthe next billing date). \n• Performance / results"
        }
