          "pageContent": "since work capacity is reserved in advance. \n• Clients can cancel future months with written notice (e.g., 14–30 days before \nthe next billing date). \n• Performance / results \n• No guarantees of specific revenue or follower numbers; the company focuses \non best-effort implementation of agreed systems. \n• Where performance bonuses are agreed, they are paid on clearly defined, \nverifiable metrics (e.g., extra commission above a baseline). \n• Disputes \n• Clients should raise issues as soon as possible so they can be solved during \nthe engagement. \n• Any disputes that cannot be resolved informally may follow the escalation \nand governing-law clauses in the written agreement. \n \nSupport, SLAs, and communication \n• Channels \n• Support via email, shared Slack/Discord, or project management tools \n(Notion, ClickUp, etc.), depending on the plan. \n• Response times"
