          "pageContent": "• Standard: responses in 24–48 business hours. \n• Premium retainers can include faster response windows (e.g., same-day or \nwithin 4 hours during business days). \n• Uptime & reliability \n• Uses reputable automation platforms and AI providers, but cannot guarantee \n100% uptime because third-party tools can fail. \n• Critical automations can include fallback/backup paths where feasible (e.g., \nbackup email if an API is down). \n \nData, privacy, and compliance \n• Data usage \n• Client data is only used to configure and run the agreed automations and \nagents. \n• Access to accounts and logs is limited to people working on the project. \n• Storage & retention \n• Conversation logs and workflow data may be stored in tools like n8n, \nspreadsheets, or CRMs as configured with the client. \n• Clients can request export or deletion of stored data within reasonable \ntechnical limits of the underlying tools. \n• Legal note \n• Clients remain responsible for their own compliance (e.g., GDPR/CCPA/email"
